SUMMARY:Men's Soccer Alumni Weekend
DESCRIPTION:The men’s soccer program is hosting an alumni weekend in September. On Friday the 18th is an optional golf outing and evening social. Then on Saturday the 19th is tailgating and lunch before the 3:30 p.m. game against Tusculum. For more information contact Coach Gregg Munn at gmunn@mhu.edu.
URL:https://www.mhu.edu/event/mens-soccer-alumni-weekend/
