SUMMARY:Homecoming
DESCRIPTION:Save the dates for Homecoming weekend\, which will be October 2 and 3. We’re in the early stages of planning and will have information posted soon about reunions\, band and cloggers performances\, and much more. Keep an eye on upcoming newsletters and on the Homecoming website at www.mhu.edu/homecoming for updates! \nThe Bascom Lamar Lunsford Festival and the Madison Heritage Arts Festival are also happening that Saturday\, so there will be a lot to see\, hear\, and do on campus that weekend!
URL:https://www.mhu.edu/event/homecoming/
LOCATION:NC
CATEGORIES:Academic Calendar,Alumni,Featured,Public Events
