SUMMARY:MHU-Franklin Connects
DESCRIPTION:Calling all Franklin-area friends and alumni of Mars Hill University! Join us for food\, fun\, and fellowship. \nSchedule: \n\n11:30 a.m.: Tour of the MHU Campus Center\n12–1 pm: Tailgate in the parking lot of Ferguson Math and Science Center (across Athletic Street from Meares Stadium)\nLunch is provided. Bring your own chair. (Rain location: Wren Student Union)\n1 p.m.: Football game — MHU Lions vs. Wingate University Bulldogs\n(Reserved seating for the group.)\n\nHosted by: \n\nSuzanne & Jeff Wade\nKay & Ben Wax\nPaula & Rob Kahn\n\nRegister:
